==Description==
The '''Unholy Fire Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 38 of the regular [[Null & Void Event#Null & Void Battle Pass|Null & Void Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{GumDrops|1,125}} or {{Robux|72}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{GumDrops|19,295}} or {{Robux|2,982}}. Prior to the 20% discount, it had a cost of {{Robux|90}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Robux|3,745}}.

The '''Unholy Fire Nametag''' has green with a dark green outline. A fire with light and dark green flames appear on the around the name. 

